WEBVTT

00:00:00.372 --> 00:00:01.093
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:01.957 --> 00:00:03.766
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What time do you <b>get up</b>?

00:00:05.288 --> 00:00:07.965
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I don’t usually <b>go out</b> during the week.

00:00:09.982 --> 00:00:10.715
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:12.825
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Put on</b> your coat.

00:00:13.574 --> 00:00:14.782
<b>Put</b> your coat <b>on</b>.

00:00:15.365 --> 00:00:16.282
<b>Put</b> it <b>on</b>!

00:00:17.736 --> 00:00:19.239
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>Turn off</b> the TV.

00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:21.696
<b>Turn</b> the TV <b>off</b>.

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:23.297
<b>Turn</b> it <b>off</b>.

00:00:25.375 --> 00:00:26.271
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:27.205 --> 00:00:29.067
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m <b>looking for</b> my glasses.

00:00:30.516 --> 00:00:32.535
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have you found your glasses?

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.780
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m still <b>looking for</b> them.